Integrated COS and SDG Assignment
Bank Marketing - Prediction & Customer Segmentation
=====================================================
Complete Data Science workflow:
Data Retrieval -> Data Cleaning -> Data Transformation -> Data Exploration ->
Descriptive Statistics -> Statistical Inference -> Model Building -> Prediction ->
